---
/**
 * PieceArt — the die-cut jigsaw slab behind a card's content.
 *
 * All vector, no filters, no raster layers: the slab bodies are rounded
 * boxes and the joints are small SVGs (crisp at any zoom, cheap to paint —
 * the old masked filter stack rasterised and blurred under the grid
 * transform: that was both the pixelation and the lag).
 *
 * Four layers, back to front:
 *   piece-shadow — the cast shadow, below only (the grid tilts on one axis,
 *                  so the bottom edge is the only side we see);
 *   piece-wall   — the slab's side wall below the face;
 *   piece-face   — the flat face, with the sockets cut in the page colour;
 *   piece-knobs  — the piece's own balls, painted above every face so a
 *                  neighbour's ball always fills the socket it mates with.
 * The joint is the classic shape from Ricardo's outline — big ball hugging
 * the edge, short concave scallops, narrow opening — at edge midpoints.
 */
---

<span class="piece piece-base" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="piece-shadow">
    <span class="piece-body"></span>
    <svg class="joint joint-r" width="88" height="100" viewBox="0 0 88 100"><path d="M0 22.5C0 14 14 5 22 2.6A50 50 0 1 1 22 97.4C14 95 0 86 0 77.5Z"/></svg>
    <svg class="joint joint-b" width="100" height="88" viewBox="0 0 100 88"><path d="M77.5 0C86 0 95 14 97.4 22A50 50 0 1 1 2.6 22C5 14 14 0 22.5 0Z"/></svg>
  </span>
  <span class="piece-wall">
    <span class="piece-body"></span>
    <svg class="joint joint-r" width="88" height="100" viewBox="0 0 88 100"><path d="M0 22.5C0 14 14 5 22 2.6A50 50 0 1 1 22 97.4C14 95 0 86 0 77.5Z"/></svg>
    <svg class="joint joint-b" width="100" height="88" viewBox="0 0 100 88"><path d="M77.5 0C86 0 95 14 97.4 22A50 50 0 1 1 2.6 22C5 14 14 0 22.5 0Z"/></svg>
  </span>
  <span class="piece-face">
    <span class="piece-body"></span>
    <svg class="joint joint-r" width="88" height="100" viewBox="0 0 88 100"><path d="M0 22.5C0 14 14 5 22 2.6A50 50 0 1 1 22 97.4C14 95 0 86 0 77.5Z"/></svg>
    <svg class="joint joint-b" width="100" height="88" viewBox="0 0 100 88"><path d="M77.5 0C86 0 95 14 97.4 22A50 50 0 1 1 2.6 22C5 14 14 0 22.5 0Z"/></svg>
    <svg class="joint joint-l" width="88" height="100" viewBox="0 0 88 100"><path class="piece-socket" d="M0 22.5C0 14 14 5 22 2.6A50 50 0 1 1 22 97.4C14 95 0 86 0 77.5Z"/></svg>
    <svg class="joint joint-t" width="100" height="88" viewBox="0 0 100 88"><path class="piece-socket" d="M77.5 0C86 0 95 14 97.4 22A50 50 0 1 1 2.6 22C5 14 14 0 22.5 0Z"/></svg>
  </span>
</span>

<span class="piece piece-knobs" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="joint joint-r" width="88" height="100" viewBox="0 0 88 100"><path d="M0 22.5C0 14 14 5 22 2.6A50 50 0 1 1 22 97.4C14 95 0 86 0 77.5Z"/></svg>
  <svg class="joint joint-b" width="100" height="88" viewBox="0 0 100 88"><path d="M77.5 0C86 0 95 14 97.4 22A50 50 0 1 1 2.6 22C5 14 14 0 22.5 0Z"/></svg>
</span>
